  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "If something prevents the migration from completing in the first run it may be difficult to fix the issue and resume without having to start over.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Add support for a basic \"resume from\" scenario.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "To do so accurately, may require the use of transactions and roll-back to ensure that all completed objects were completed correctly.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
